Sentence 4: Mitochondrial "Complex III" uses this second type of proton pump, which is mediated by a quinone (the Q cycle).
Sentence 5: The mitochondrial NADH is then oxidized in turn by the electron transport chain, which pumps protons across a membrane and generates ATP through oxidative phosphorylation.
