Sentence 1: The Vandals had occupied Roman North Africa in the early 5th century, and established an independent kingdom there.
Sentence 2: Although primarily remembered for the sack of Rome in 455 and their persecution of Nicene Christians in favor of Arian Christianity, the Vandals were also patrons of learning.
