Sentence 1: On April 26, 2010, Eminem posted a message through his Twitter account that read, "I'm 'Not Afraid", without any elaboration.
Sentence 2: Fans and news organizations were able to interpret the message and announced that Eminem's first single from his seventh studio album, "Recovery" would be titled "Not Afraid".
Sentence 3: Not Afraid
Not Afraid "Not Afraid" is a song by American rapper Eminem from his seventh studio album "Recovery" (2010).
Sentence 4: "Not Afraid" was first revealed as a single by Eminem via Twitter, after which the song debuted on radio.
Sentence 5: "Not Afraid" was written and produced by Eminem, Boi-1da, Jordan Evans and Matthew Burnett; keyboardist Luis Resto was also attributed with songwriting credit.
