Sentence 1: Kanichee Mine
Kanichee Mine The Kanichee Mine, also less commonly known as the Ajax Mine, is an abandoned base metal and precious metal mine, located in the Temagami region of northeastern Ontario, Canada.
Sentence 2: It is near the small unincorporated community of Temagami North, accessed by the Kanichee Mine Road from Highway 11.
Sentence 3: The Kanichee Mine zone has been explored and mined discontinuously from as early as 1910.
Sentence 4: To date, the discontinuous operation of Kanichee Mine has produced 4.2 million pounds
