Sentence 2: The most familiar species is "Incarvillea delavayi", a garden plant commonly known as hardy gloxinia or Chinese trumpet flower.
Sentence 3: Unlike most other members of Bignoniaceae, which are mainly tropical woody plants, species of "Incarvillea" are herbs from temperate regions.
