Sentence 1: Camfranglais Camfranglais, Francanglais, or Francamglais (portmanteau of the French adjectives "camerounais", "français", and "anglais") is a pidgin language of Cameroon, consisting of a macaronic mixture of Cameroonian French, Cameroonian English and Cameroonian Pidgin English, in addition to lexical contributions from various indigenous languages of Cameroon.
