Sentence 4: SETILive
SETILive SETILive was an online project of Zooniverse that utilized live participants to analyze radio telescope data in real time to recognize patterns to find extraterrestrial intelligences (ETI's).
Sentence 5: SETILive uses data provided by the Allen Telescope Array and presents it visually so that the public can collectively search for radio signals.
Sentence 6: The project focuses on radio frequencies that automated detection systems ignore due to the prevalence of man-made noise.
