Sentence 3: Paytm is available in 10 Indian languages and offers online use-cases like mobile recharges, utility bill payments, travel, movies, and events bookings as well as in-store payments at grocery stores, fruits and vegetable shops, restaurants, parking, tolls, pharmacies and education institutions with the Paytm QR code.
Sentence 4: California based PayPal had filed a case against Paytm in the Indian trademark office for using a logo similar to its own on 18 November 2016.
Sentence 5: As of January 2018, Paytm is valued at $10 billion.
