Sentence 5: When the dogs arrived in the Iberian Peninsula is not known; they may have come with nomads sometime in prehistory, or have been brought by the Romans when they ruled the area thousands of years ago.
Sentence 6: It is often supposed that the breed is related to the Tibetan Mastiff, but no proof of this exists.
